1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,848
A favourite one mark question.

2
00:00:01,848 --> 00:00:05,507
Which concentration unit does not change with temperature?

3
00:00:05,507 --> 00:00:11,458
Any unit that uses the volume of solution changes, because liquids expand when heated.

4
00:00:11,458 --> 00:00:18,033
Molality, percentage by mass and mole fraction use only masses, so they stay fixed.

